                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} B:\mathcal{T}_\mathcal{U}(A) \to \mathcal{U}
          %p
            There are two ways to say that
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
