            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/equivalence+in+homotopy+type+theory"} type of equivalences
            between the type reflections of
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
